 maple shell, three-ways key. You tighten everything at the top, nothing from the bottom. Beautiful hand drum. It's now in a museum, somewhere up here in San Francisco. I can't thing of the guy - an Italian guy, got it from me. It starts with an F. I'll think of his name too. He collects snare drums.", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q11642$F75C0F14-E16E-4206-A1EA-6E09C789A5EC", "rank": "normal"}], "P20": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P20", "hash": "952fab56c4c499203ed20ed131dba079985aba05", "datavalue": {"value": "https://semlab.s3.amazonaws.com/texts/8c3ff6578b7b25fa86a7c9d7a9053d1b/846.txt", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "url"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q11642$7CA213AF-9E57-4380-A187-E0B79422EEE5", "rank": "normal"}], "P21": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "46c3ea01ad8abf60446724c9c1bb752a5c9ee216", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1300, "id": "Q1300"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q11642$FAA04B8A-6586-42DA-8F66-F404D6A186AC", "rank": "normal"}], "P22": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P22", "hash": "0e5ce292df993d79dcf01467e0e5a2c8509775e9", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 240, "id": "Q240"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q11642$5E584797-9960-4182-A6F8-AA9E8979F0E0", "rank": "normal"}], "P23": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P23", "hash": "6728b1d69fb03de3e91c83a040b2b8876a0c8810", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 240, "id": "Q240"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q11642$A15357BA-AF15-45C9-B6E9-627459A4C9E4", "rank": "normal"}]}}